{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52184","headline":"颂六十二首 九 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"亏功九仞罢崇山，顿驾千里倦长路。\n改涂悔善因芳音，易情梁恶良妖妪。\n五福精修既不成，八关守戒谁能护。\n攸攸极夜尔何期，森森爱流安可度。\n（见同书同卷《破斋部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52184.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52184","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}